{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>DEADSWITCH COMBAT</strong> is an action packed 2D multiplayer shooter that builds upon the previous games.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WHAT'S IN THE DEMO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo includes access to all game features except:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No ability to host a custom multiplayer server</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No controller support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Limited mod support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No in-game purchases</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">RANKED PROGRESSION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775080/extras/banner_1.png?t=1748749799\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Progress through the ranks</strong> by earning XP in-game by killing enemies, scoring objectives, and completing challenges. Unlock new weapons, attachments, equipment, and vehicles to help you achieve victory in combat. Play <strong>solo</strong> or <strong>team-based</strong> game modes with other players online, or play local games against bots to hone your skills.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CO-OP SURVIVAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775080/extras/banner_2.png?t=1748749799\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Play one of many Survival modes</strong> and last as long as you can against endless waves of soldiers, helicopters, zombies, and other creatures. Submit your score in the worldwide leaderboards!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FULL WEAPON CUSTOMIZATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775080/extras/banner_weapons.png?t=1748749799\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Personalize over 200 weapons</strong> with optics, lasers, grips, skins, and other accessories.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">IN-GAME EDITOR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775080/extras/banner_editor.png?t=1748749799\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Create your own maps and missions</strong> with the in-game editor and instantly play them with friends online! Share or browse creations in the Workshop.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plenty of game modes and maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Massive selection of weapons, attachments, equipment, and skins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fully customizable characters and loadouts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ranked matches, multiplayer clans, and custom servers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Intense fast-paced gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In-game editor and mod-friendly</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3775080?t=1748749799","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775080/453b5662406c0a0fc8a246e7fce309e82e9d1df7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748749799","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775080/a3a9e8b27b425e3b3d8ee7d9406439259fc9fd66/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748749799","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775080/a3a9e8b27b425e3b3d8ee7d9406439259fc9fd66/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748749799","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Includ